 "verdicts": {
  "Factory Private (private preview, announced 2026-09-18) offers two deployment models: Factory Managed keeps the control plane hosted while Droids run on developer machines, CI/CD infrastructure or managed Droid Computers, and Factory Private places some or all infrastructure in the customer's VPC with sandbox execution through OpenCompute and customer IAM/network/security controls.": 1,
  "Factory introduced Factory Private on September 18, 2026, where Factory runs the control plane while Droid sandboxes run in the customer's VPC through OpenCompute, alongside the Factory Managed deployment model.": 1,
  "Factory said the NVIDIA Nemotron research team used Factory Private for post-training, evaluation and optimization while keeping code, models and IP in its own infrastructure.": 1,
  "NVIDIA's Nemotron research team used Factory Private for post-training Nemotron 3 Ultra, including evaluation and optimization.": 1
 }
